### 예약 생성 — 선택한 campaign마다 예약 행 생성 (reserved_at은 KST, 시 단위)
POST {{host}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "테스트 캠페인 v2",
	"tracking_url": "https://app.appsflyer.com/com.example.app?pid=new",
	"reserved_at": "2026-08-20 10:00:00",
	"campaign_ids": [1]
}

### 예약 목록 조회 — advertising 단위 필터
GET {{host}}/reservations?advertisingId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 예약 삭제
DELETE {{host}}/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
